Implement user story AMSD-1820: [Mozio] - Promo code amount not displayed for Return trip tickets in Mozio email confirmation

## Story Description
[Mozio] - The Promo code amount is NOT displayed as expected for Return trip tickets in the Mozio email confirmation. For return trip Mozio reservations that have a promo code applied, the discount amount is missing from the email confirmation, whereas it appears correctly for one-way trips.

