These are observable checks, derived from the acceptance criteria and description. They describe WHAT is observed, not how to build it. Make the minimal change that makes all of these true; your accompanying test should assert them:
- When a return trip Mozio reservation includes a promo code, the confirmation email displays the promo code discount amount
- When a one-way Mozio reservation includes a promo code, the confirmation email displays the promo code discount amount
- When a return trip Mozio reservation has no promo code, the confirmation email does not display any promo code discount section or amount

